<title>DENMARK: Denmark's EAC pulls out of Carlsberg unit.</title>
<headline>Denmark's EAC pulls out of Carlsberg unit.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and trading group East Asiatic Company (EAC) said on Wednesday it had agreed to sell its 20 percent holding in brewer Carlsberg's Hong Kong unit.</p>
</text>
